1
00:00:00,119 --> 00:00:01,976
Tanken din fortjener dette til

2
00:00:01,976 --> 00:00:03,599
tilbudspris akkurat nå.

3
00:00:03,599 --> 00:00:05,968
Beskytt IBC-tanken din mot alger

4
00:00:05,968 --> 00:00:07,539
og UV-stråling.

5
00:00:07,539 --> 00:00:09,659
Akkurat nå til kampanjepris.

6
00:00:09,659 --> 00:00:11,644
Ordinær pris er faktisk 586

7
00:00:11,644 --> 00:00:14,071
kroner, men i dag betaler du bare

8
00:00:14,071 --> 00:00:15,319
439 kroner.

9
00:00:15,319 --> 00:00:17,319
Kraftig oxford-stoff.

10
00:00:17,319 --> 00:00:18,959
Enkel glidelås.

11
00:00:18,959 --> 00:00:20,665
Passer perfekt til standard

12
00:00:20,665 --> 00:00:22,139
tusenliters tank.

13
00:00:22,139 --> 00:00:24,219
Men lageret minker raskt.

14
00:00:24,219 --> 00:00:26,615
Bare 439 kroner i dag, men kun så

15
00:00:26,615 --> 00:00:28,459
lenge lageret rekker.

16
00:00:28,459 --> 00:00:29,659
Beverbutikken.

17
00:00:29,659 --> 00:00:30,979
Bestill nå.
